ing":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":true,"topics":["bitbucket","cicd","devops","docker-registry-v2","git","git-gui","git-server","gitea","github","github-actions","gitlab","go","golang","hacktoberfest","maven-server","npm-registry","vue"],"visibility":"public","forks":6255,"open_issues":2890,"watchers":52486,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"<!-- NOTE: If your issue is a security concern, please send an email to security@gitea.io instead of opening a public issue -->\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n    1. Please speak English, this is the language all maintainers can speak and write.\r\n    2. Please ask questions or configuration/deploy problems on our Discord \r\n       server (https://discord.gg/gitea) or forum (https://discourse.gitea.io).\r\n    3. Please take a moment to check that your issue doesn't already exist.\r\n    4. Please give all relevant information below for bug reports, because \r\n       incomplete details will be handled as an invalid report.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n- Gitea version (or commit ref): \r\n- Git version: 1.13.0+dev-273-g15d3aa7b9\r\n- Operating system: macOS Catalina + Docker\r\n- Database (use `[x]`):\r\n  - [ ] PostgreSQL\r\n  - [x] MySQL\r\n  - [ ] MSSQL\r\n  - [ ] SQLite\r\n- Can you reproduce the bug at https://try.gitea.io:\r\n  - [ ] Yes (provide example URL)\r\n  - [ ] No\r\n  - [x] Not relevant\r\n- Log gist:\r\n\r\n## Description\r\n\r\nI'm unable to connect to gitea via SSH. I get the following error : _Permission denied (publickey)_\r\nI'm using gitea/gitea:latest docker image and my docker-compose.yaml is the following:\r\n\r\n```\r\nversion: \"2\"\r\n\r\nservices:\r\n  gitea:\r\n    image: gitea/gitea:latest\r\n    environment:\r\n      - USER_UID=1000\r\n      - USER_GID=1000\r\n      - DB_TYPE=mysql\r\n      - DB_HOST=db:3306\r\n      - DB_NAME=gitea\r\n      - DB_USER=gitea\r\n      - DB_PASSWD=gitea\r\n    volumes:\r\n      - ./gitea:/data\r\n      #- /etc/timezone:/etc/timezone:ro\r\n      #- /etc/localtime:/etc/localtime:ro\r\n    ports:\r\n      #- \"3000:3000\"\r\n      - \"222:22\"\r\n    labels:\r\n      - \"traefik.enable=true\"\r\n      - \"traefik.backend=gitea\"\r\n      - \"traefik.frontend.rule=Host:\"\r\n      - \"traefik.port=3000\"\r\n\r\n    restart: unless-stopped\r\n    networks:\r\n      - traefik_default\r\n      - gitea\r\n\r\n  db:\r\n    image: mysql:5.7\r\n    restart: always\r\n    environment:\r\n      - MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD=gitea\r\n      - MYSQL_USER=gitea\r\n      - MYSQL_PASSWORD=gitea\r\n      - MYSQL_DATABASE=gitea\r\n    networks:\r\n      - gitea\r\n    volumes:\r\n      - ./mysql:/var/lib/mysql\r\n\r\nnetworks:\r\n  traefik_default:\r\n    external:\r\n      name: traefik_default\r\n  gitea:\r\n    external: false\r\n```\r\n\r\nI've looked at https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/issues/5623 and https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/issues/2555, and they don't seem relevant to my problem.\r\n\r\nI've installed my RSA public key using the gitea web interface, then I checked that the key is written in _/data/git/.ssh/authorized_keys_.\r\n\r\nI'm not using the built-in ssh server, so I've also tried running _Update the '.ssh/authorized_keys' file with Gitea SSH keys._ from the Gitea control panel, but nothing happens (the file is not modified whatsoever, but no errors in log).\r\n\r\nWhen trying to connect from my host using ssh command with debug enabled, I get the following trace:\r\n\r\n```\r\nOpenSSH_8.1p1, LibreSSL 2.7.3\r\ndebug1: Reading configuration data /etc/ssh/ssh_config\r\ndebug1: /etc/ssh/ssh_config line 47: Applying options for *\r\ndebug1: Connecting to localhost port 222.\r\ndebug1: Connection established.\r\ndebug1: identity file /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_rsa type 0\r\ndebug1: identity file /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_rsa-cert type -1\r\ndebug1: identity file /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_dsa type -1\r\ndebug1: identity file /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_dsa-cert type -1\r\ndebug1: identity file /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_ecdsa type -1\r\ndebug1: identity file /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_ecdsa-cert type -1\r\ndebug1: identity file /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_ed25519 type -1\r\ndebug1: identity file /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_ed25519-cert type -1\r\ndebug1: identity file /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_xmss type -1\r\ndebug1: identity file /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_xmss-cert type -1\r\ndebug1: Local version string SSH-2.0-OpenSSH_8.1\r\ndebug1: Remote protocol version 2.0, remote software version OpenSSH_8.3\r\ndebug1: match: OpenSSH_8.3 pat OpenSSH* compat 0x04000000\r\ndebug1: Authenticating to localhost:222 as 'pierre'\r\ndebug1: SSH2_MSG_KEXINIT sent\r\ndebug1: SSH2_MSG_KEXINIT received\r\ndebug1: kex: algorithm: curve25519-sha256\r\ndebug1: kex: host key algorithm: ecdsa-sha2-nistp256\r\ndebug1: kex: server->client cipher: chacha20-poly1305@openssh.com MAC: <implicit> compression: none\r\ndebug1: kex: client->server cipher: chacha20-poly1305@openssh.com MAC: <implicit> compression: none\r\ndebug1: expecting SSH2_MSG_KEX_ECDH_REPLY\r\ndebug1: Server host key: ecdsa-sha2-nistp256 \r\ndebug1: Host '[localhost]:222' is known and matches the ECDSA host key.\r\ndebug1: Found key in /Users/pierre/.ssh/known_hosts:5\r\ndebug1: rekey out after 134217728 blocks\r\ndebug1: SSH2_MSG_NEWKEYS sent\r\ndebug1: expecting SSH2_MSG_NEWKEYS\r\ndebug1: SSH2_MSG_NEWKEYS received\r\ndebug1: rekey in after 134217728 blocks\r\ndebug1: Will attempt key: /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_rsa RSA \r\ndebug1: Will attempt key: /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_dsa\r\ndebug1: Will attempt key: /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_ecdsa\r\ndebug1: Will attempt key: /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_ed25519\r\ndebug1: Will attempt key: /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_xmss\r\ndebug1: SSH2_MSG_EXT_INFO received\r\ndebug1: kex_input_ext_info: server-sig-algs=<ssh-ed25519,sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com,ssh-rsa,rsa-sha2-256,rsa-sha2-512,ssh-dss,ecdsa-sha2-nistp256,ecdsa-sha2-nistp384,ecdsa-sha2-nistp521,sk-ecdsa-sha2-nistp256@openssh.com>\r\ndebug1: SSH2_MSG_SERVICE_ACCEPT received\r\ndebug1: Authentications that can continue: publickey\r\ndebug1: Next authentication method: publickey\r\ndebug1: Offering public key: /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_rsa RSA \r\ndebug1: Authentications that can continue: publickey\r\ndebug1: Trying private key: /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_dsa\r\ndebug1: Trying private key: /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_ecdsa\r\ndebug1: Trying private key: /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_ed25519\r\ndebug1: Trying private key: /Users/pierre/.ssh/id_xmss\r\ndebug1: No more authentication methods to try.\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt clearly looks like the ssh server is not finding my public key I installed previously to check against my private key that IS offered by my ssh client.\r\n\r\n**I then connected to the running gitea docker container and ran _ps_. I saw that the ssh server is running as _root_, whereas the gitea server is running as the _git_ user. Could that explain the problem? Since authorized_keys are installed for the _git_ user (_/data/git/.ssh/authorized_keys_), then _sshd_ running as _root_ doesn't load this particular file.** \r\n\r\n```\r\n    1 root      0:00 /bin/s6-svscan /etc/s6\r\n   12 root      0:00 s6-supervise gitea\r\n   13 root      0:00 s6-supervise openssh\r\n   14 root      0:00 sshd: /usr/sbin/sshd -D -e [listener] 0 of 10-100 startups\r\n   15 git       1:05 /app/gitea/gitea web\r\n   56 git       0:00 bash\r\n   61 git       0:00 ps\r\n```\r\n\r\nNow, I'm at a loss what to do next. I tried switching to the \"built-in ssh server\" to no avail. \r\n\r\nHere is the server section of my current app.ini\r\n\r\n```\r\n[server]\r\nAPP_DATA_PATH    = /data/gitea\r\nSSH_DOMAIN       = \r\nHTTP_PORT        = 3000\r\nROOT_URL         = http://...\r\nDISABLE_SSH      = false\r\nSTART_SSH_SERVER = false\r\nSSH_PORT         = 222\r\nSSH_LISTEN_PORT  = 22\r\nLFS_START_SERVER = true\r\nLFS_CONTENT_PATH = /data/git/lfs\r\nDOMAIN           = \r\nLFS_JWT_SECRET   = \r\nOFFLINE_MODE     = false\r\n```\r\n\r\nThanks for your help!\r\n\r\n\r\n## Screenshots\r\n\r\n<!-- **If this issue involves the Web Interface, please include a screenshot** -->\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/12154/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/12154/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":4030174725,"node_id":"MDExOkxvY2tlZEV2ZW50NDAzMDE3NDcyNQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/events/4030174725","actor":{"login":"go-gitea","id":12724356,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEyNzI0MzU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12724356?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go-gitea/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"locked","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-11-24T00:11:12Z","lock_reason":null,"performed_via_github_app":null}]